<title>USA: Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude for mid-August.</title>
<headline>Chile seeks 960,000 bbls of crude for mid-August.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's state oil company Empresa Nacional del Petroleo (ENAP) is seeking to buy 960,000 barrels of crude oil for August 14-18 delivery, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids will be received and the tender awarded on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Elsewhere in South America, Uruguay's state oil refiner ANCAP is seeking to buy one million barrels of crude for August 18-28 delivery.</p>
<p>The Uruguayan tender will be awarded late on July 3.</p>
<p>((--Patricia Garip-Bertuol NY Energy Desk ((+1 212 859 1620))</p>
</text>
